#: ../../library/typing.rst:3963
msgid ""
"These types (and the corresponding functions) are generic "
"over :data:`AnyStr`. ``Pattern`` can be specialised as ``Pattern[str]`` or "
"``Pattern[bytes]``; ``Match`` can be specialised as ``Match[str]`` or "
"``Match[bytes]``."
msgstr ""
"Diese Typen (und die entsprechenden Funktionen) sind generisch über "
":data:`AnyStr`. ``Pattern`` kann zu ``Pattern[str]`` oder ``Pattern[bytes]`` "
"spezialisiert werden, ``Match`` zu ``Match[str]`` oder ``Match[bytes]``."

#: ../../library/typing.rst:3968
msgid ""
"Classes ``Pattern`` and ``Match`` from :mod:`re` now support ``[]``. "
"See :pep:`585` and :ref:`types-genericalias`."
msgstr ""
